        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "The best overall roofing material for Utah is architectural Asphalt Shingles\n\nfor value, or Metal Roofing\nfor high-elevation durability against heavy snow and extreme temperature swings.",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "text": "Asphalt Shingles",
            "link": "https://shelley-construction.com/blog/best-roofing-materials-utah-weather"
          },
          {
            "text": "Metal Roofing",
            "link": "https://www.framerestorationutah.com/blog/utah/best-roofing-materials-utah"
          }
        ],
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "architectural Asphalt Shingles"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          8,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Utah weather brings intense summer UV rays, high wind gusts, severe freeze-thaw cycles, and heavy mountain snow loads. The right choice depends on your budget and elevation.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          9,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Top Options for Utah"
